      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> the caster picks one of Blinded, Deafened, Paralyzed or Poisoned that the target has, and it ends; nothing is asked when the target has none of them. It changes no item: midi applies it to any item with the identifier <code>lesser-restoration</code> (2024 rules) that nothing else automates.</p>",
      "chatFlavor": ""
    },
    "identifier": "lesser-restoration-overlay",
